# No requirements.in alongside this one: nothing here ships or runs outside
# the test suite, so there is no runtime half to separate out. That is also
# why this file compiles without a -c constraint - there is no runtime
# resolution for it to agree with.
pytest
PyYAML
ruff

# Runs the suite across cores - 24s serial against 12s on four workers. These
# tests parse workflow YAML and hold no state between them, so there is
# nothing for the split to disturb.
pytest-xdist
